# resale-ops locations (template)

Copy to `.cursor/rules/resale-ops.mdc` in your sales project, or paste the JSON into **Cursor User rules** for all repos.

See `skills/resale-ops/references/project-memory-snippet.md` for the JSON shape.

Forks of [resale-ops](https://github.com/mkayander/resale-ops): the upstream repo may ship an owner-specific `.cursor/rules/resale-ops.mdc`; replace IDs or delete and use User rules + your Drive `.resale-locations.json`.
